{"id":"662298","name":"五香茶叶蛋","author":"圆小π","authorId":"1365842","desc":"","cover":"images/662298/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"4个"},{"name":"鹌鹑蛋","amount":"16个"}],"sub":[{"name":"红茶叶","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"将蛋表皮清洗干净。","img":"images/662298/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加水煮熟。","img":"images/662298/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"准备大料，冲洗一下。","img":"images/662298/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中加水，放入所有大料和调料煮开。","img":"images/662298/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"煮熟的蛋把皮敲碎。","img":"images/662298/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"把蛋放进卤汁中煮5分钟。","img":"images/662298/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入红茶叶，关火。","img":"images/662298/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"蛋在卤汤中浸泡一晚上，更入味，颜色也更明显。","img":"images/662298/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"五香茶叶蛋。","img":"images/662298/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}